Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.69,Title,,23,23,23,,{\a7\fs45\pos(496.098,1027.667)}Brought to you by Blu-Flash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.35,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(718,80)}The Plant Pen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.23,0:00:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How pretty! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I raised them with all my heart, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.99,0:00:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, I never had a slightest idea that you love planting flowers, Suneo-{\i1}san{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,"Those who love flowers have a pure heart".
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.95,0:00:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What a show-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I love flowers, so I wanna plant some.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Last year, someone planted some morning glory seeds...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.71,0:00:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...but never even bothered to take proper care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And who that boy might be, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.89,0:00:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So what flower do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All I care is about a flower, any would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.81,0:00:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pull one out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.19,0:00:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a pen, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.69,0:00:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Disappointed already?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.28,0:00:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you want to show-off to Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}?....
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.07,0:00:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.66,0:01:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then allow me to demonstrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.95,0:01:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,First, draw a flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.62,0:01:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then after coloring it...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.21,0:01:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And here's our seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.13,0:01:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The seed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.30,0:01:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Now let's plant it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.72,0:01:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Pour plenty of water into the pot...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.73,0:01:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And then we just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And how long does it take?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.31,0:01:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just have some patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.33,0:01:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Plant Pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.95,0:01:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It grows exactly as you painted it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.79,0:01:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and the more water you pour in, the bigger it will grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.71,0:01:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but this flower looks like children's doodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.21,0:01:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I drew it in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.84,0:01:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's draw one from the encyclopedia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.22,0:02:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then roll it into a ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, how beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.10,0:02:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you grew it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.77,0:02:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's just say that I really love flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.78,0:02:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, it's actually quite easy to plant such flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.79,0:02:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you could make them even prettier than me, Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.25,0:02:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.91,0:02:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What? A Plant Pen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.25,0:02:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds fun! Let me try it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure! Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.35,0:02:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.85,0:02:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She sure drew a lot of 'em...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.73,0:02:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I beat Suneo in his own game!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone must be talking about me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.36,0:03:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's a given considering that a boy as intelligent, refined...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.78,0:03:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,cultured and polite as me is being praised.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.33,0:03:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, there's no way that Nobita'd plant flowers at his home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.25,0:03:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he must have bought them at a flower shop. Now, I'm gonna find out the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.97,0:03:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.14,0:03:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You drew lot of flowers, Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}... How beautiful they all look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I always wanted to be surrounded by flowers like this, at least once in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! I'm gonna draw one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.31,0:03:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.69,0:03:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.24,0:03:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurts, how dare you, Suneo....!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.20,0:03:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.75,0:03:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you pay, goddammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.42,0:03:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, this tree looks really strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.01,0:04:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What will this bald tree sprout?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.80,0:04:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.23,0:04:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tasty, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! I'm gonna draw an amusing tree too...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.70,0:04:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Need a sheet of paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.99,0:04:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Found one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.66,0:04:29.70,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fs48\pos(706.641,170)}Washing Machine
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.70,0:04:29.74,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fs48\pos(714.656,186)}Washing Machine
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.74,0:04:29.79,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(703.97,204.667)}Washing Machine
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.79,0:04:30.95,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(703.97,223.334)}Washing Machine
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.66,0:04:29.70,Sign2,,0,0,0,,{\fs48\pos(535.659,458)}User Manual
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.70,0:04:29.74,Sign2,,0,0,0,,{\fs48\pos(484.898,492.667)}User Manual
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.74,0:04:29.79,Sign2,,0,0,0,,{\fs72\\pos(468.868,596.667)}User Manual
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.79,0:04:30.95,Sign2,,0,0,0,,{\fs72\\pos(353.989,684.667)}User Manual
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.04,0:04:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you pouring so much water?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.00,0:04:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a surprise, you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.25,0:04:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now gimme that bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.05,0:04:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And now we wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:04:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our home. Let's go and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A wooden bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.45,0:05:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But the clothes are all wood... I can't wear them...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The cups and dispenser are all made of wood, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have some tea on this wood table.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.17,0:05:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But tea alone is kinda boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring some sweets from our home. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.71,0:05:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I have got them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.43,0:05:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,In the clothes go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,An earthquake!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.05,0:06:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's about time to dry the clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.52,0:06:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have drawn the tree house on the washing machine's user manual page...
